sequenceDiagram
    participant App as app.py
    participant PS as ProjectService
    participant PR as ProjectRepository
    participant BR as BindingRepository
    participant CR as ConfigRepository
    participant TR as TaskRepository
    participant SS as SynthesisService
    participant SPS as SupplementService
    participant Disk as v3/全局持久化

    Note over App,Disk: == 打开项目链路 ==
    
    App->>PS: open_project_as_snapshot(name)
    PS->>PR: load_snapshot(name)
    PR->>Disk: 读 99_系统数据/配置/project.json
    PR->>Disk: 读 99_系统数据/配置/structured_script.json
    PR->>Disk: 读 99_系统数据/配置/voice_bindings.json
    PR-->>PS: ProjectSnapshot
    PS-->>App: ProjectSnapshot

    Note over App,Disk: == 创建项目链路 ==
    App->>PS: create_project(name, script_file)
    PS->>PR: create_project(name, script_path)
    PR->>Disk: 创建纯 v3 布局 + 复制 01_原始资料/书稿 + 写入 99_系统数据/配置/*.json
    PR->>Disk: 写入 99_系统数据/章节数据/*.json
    PR-->>PS: name
    PS-->>App: None

    Note over App,Disk: == 绑定音色链路 ==
    App->>PS: bind_voice(project, role, src, category)
    PS->>PR: get_project_dir(project)
    PR-->>PS: project_dir
    PS->>Disk: copy2(src → 01_原始资料/项目音色/)
    PS->>PR: load_project(project)
    PR-->>PS: (meta, script, bd)
    PS->>PS: update bd dict
    PS->>PR: save_bindings(project_dir, bd)
    PR->>Disk: atomic write 99_系统数据/配置/voice_bindings.json
    PR-->>PS: None
    PS->>PR: load_snapshot(project)
    PR-->>PS: fresh snapshot
    PS-->>App: dest

    Note over App,Disk: == 设置数据目录 ==
    App->>PS: set_data_dir(new_dir)
    PS->>CR: set_data_dir(new_dir)
    CR->>CR: read old config
    CR->>Disk: atomic write 全局 config.json
    PS->>PR: set WORKSPACE_ROOT
    PS-->>App: abs_path

    Note over App,Disk: == 合成提交 ==
    App->>SS: SynthesisService.start(state, project, bindings, ...)
    SS->>SS: submit worker thread
    SS->>TR: save_task(TaskRecord(task_id, "synthesis", project, "running"))
    TR->>Disk: atomic write 99_系统数据/任务/production_tasks.sqlite3
    SS-->>App: task_id

    Note over App,Disk: == 合成完成 ==
    SS->>SS: worker 完成
    SS->>TR: save_task(TaskRecord(task_id, ..., "done"))
    TR->>Disk: atomic write 99_系统数据/任务/production_tasks.sqlite3
    
    Note over App,Disk: == 补录提交 ==
    App->>SPS: synthesize_lines(role, lines, speaker, ...)
    SPS->>TR: save_task(TaskRecord(task_id, "supplement", project, "running"))
    TR->>Disk: atomic write 99_系统数据/任务/production_tasks.sqlite3
    SPS->>SPS: 逐句合成
    SPS->>TR: save_task(TaskRecord(task_id, ..., "done"))
    TR->>Disk: atomic write 99_系统数据/任务/production_tasks.sqlite3
    SPS-->>App: results

    Note over PR,Disk: v1/v2 项目仅通过 lib.project_paths 兼容读取；当前新建项目只写纯 v3 布局
